---
description:
  Exercises the elk.rectpacking sub-algorithm, which, like elk.box, returns no
  edge sections, forcing every edge onto the straight-line fallback. The
  labelled edge additionally verifies that the fallback also sets a valid label
  position rather than leaving it unset.
config:
  layout: elk.rectpacking
---
%% Same as the elk.box fixture: rectpacking returns no edge sections. The
%% labelled edge covers the label position, which the fallback must also set.
flowchart TD
  A[Start] -->|labelled| B[Middle]
  B --> C[End]
  A --> C
